{"id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#def:inner-product","title":"def:inner-product","path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD.md","line":78,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD.tex#def:inner-product","uses":[],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD.tex","label":"def:inner-product","line":98,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Inner product]\n\\label{def:inner-product}\n\\dcref{appD:D.2-def-1}\n\\group{Functional Analysis}\nA map $(\\cdot,\\cdot):H\\times H\\to\\mathbb R$ is an \\textit{inner product} if:\n\n(i) $(u,v)=(v,u)$ for all $u,v\\in H$;\n\n(ii) $u\\mapsto(u,v)$ is linear for each $v\\in H$;\n\n(iii) $(u,u)\\geq0$ for every $u\\in H$;\n\n(iv) $(u,u)=0$ if and only if $u=0$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Inner product] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a696e6e65722d70726f64756374\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. appD:D.2-def-1</span></span>\\group Functional Analysis A map <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(\\cdot ,\\cdot ):H\\times H\\to \\mathbb R$\">$(\\cdot ,\\cdot ):H\\times H\\to \\mathbb R$</span> is an <em>inner product</em> if: <p></p>(i) <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(u,v)=(v,u)$\">$(u,v)=(v,u)$</span> for all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u,v\\in H$\">$u,v\\in H$</span>; <p></p>(ii) <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u\\mapsto (u,v)$\">$u\\mapsto (u,v)$</span> is linear for each <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v\\in H$\">$v\\in H$</span>; <p></p>(iii) <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(u,u)\\geq 0$\">$(u,u)\\geq 0$</span> for every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u\\in H$\">$u\\in H$</span>; <p></p>(iv) <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(u,u)=0$\">$(u,u)=0$</span> if and only if <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u=0$\">$u=0$</span>. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#sec:hilbert-spaces","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#def:norm-from-inner-product","relations":[],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#def:norm-from-inner-product","title":"def:norm-from-inner-product","label":"def:norm-from-inner-product"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#lem:cauchy-schwarz-inequality-hilbert","title":"lem:cauchy-schwarz-inequality-hilbert","label":"lem:cauchy-schwarz-inequality-hilbert"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#def:hilbert-space","title":"def:hilbert-space","label":"def:hilbert-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#ex:l2-hilbert-space-example","title":"ex:l2-hilbert-space-example","label":"ex:l2-hilbert-space-example"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#ex:h1-hilbert-space-example","title":"ex:h1-hilbert-space-example","label":"ex:h1-hilbert-space-example"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#def:inner-product","title":"def:inner-product","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Inner product]\n\\label{def:inner-product}\n\\dcref{appD:D.2-def-1}\n\\group{Functional Analysis}\nA map $(\\cdot,\\cdot):H\\times H\\to\\mathbb R$ is an \\textit{inner product} if:\n\n(i) $(u,v)=(v,u)$ for all $u,v\\in H$;\n\n(ii) $u\\mapsto(u,v)$ is linear for each $v\\in H$;\n\n(iii) $(u,u)\\geq0$ for every $u\\in H$;\n\n(iv) $(u,u)=0$ if and only if $u=0$.\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD.tex","description":"","dependencies":[],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}